    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens after you die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the afterlife, if there even is one?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go into the light and...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find out it's playing cards with a skeleton man. Well, it is for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hogen</strong> is a <strong>digital card game</strong> drawing inspiration from Gwent and Magic: the Gathering. Place weapon, unit, and magical crystal shard cards to activate abilities and overpower your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played with just a mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a story of Life and Death as progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/79d38aadd3b9df1ef14a78e8274270be.avif?t=1743620428\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against vibrant and animated boards with custom dynamic music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/6be808460929add0fe17e3da92784538.avif?t=1743620428\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards and build your own deck to grow your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/981774d63331fd010c4bfb4146923580.avif?t=1743620428\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens after you die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the afterlife, if there even is one?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go into the light and...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find out it's playing cards with a skeleton man. Well, it is for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hogen</strong> is a <strong>digital card game</strong> drawing inspiration from Gwent and Magic: the Gathering. Place weapon, unit, and magical crystal shard cards to activate abilities and overpower your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played with just a mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a story of Life and Death as progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/79d38aadd3b9df1ef14a78e8274270be.avif?t=1743620428\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against vibrant and animated boards with custom dynamic music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/6be808460929add0fe17e3da92784538.avif?t=1743620428\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards and build your own deck to grow your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/981774d63331fd010c4bfb4146923580.avif?t=1743620428\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p>",
